- NAVEImage, NAVESeries and NAVEText with shared projectors, ordering and colours
- built-in models: b0 (input of block 1) and, for ViTs, attention keys (features="keys")
- summaries: fixed width, label=, saliency_range=, mean saliency per concept without correlation
- windows twice the input size, every half window, nearest-centre assignment
- notebooks/animations: ten animated demos
- the Springer BibTeX (doi:10.1007/978-3-032-37664-0_26) everywhere the arXiv one was
- acknowledgments: Ulf Brefeld (Leuphana University Lüneburg), for the compute
- README: the example figure again (lost in an earlier upload)
