+    "## UMAP of every block\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Two ways to keep the frames comparable:\n",
+    "- **Previous block as reference** (default, `AlignedUMAP`): all blocks fitted together, each kept close to\n",
+    "  its neighbours. Follows the gradual changes.\n",
+    "- **Last block as reference** (`init=`): every block starts from the last block's layout. Shows everything\n",
+    "  against the final organisation.\n",
+    "\n",
+    "UMAP runs unseeded here, so it can use all cores: two runs differ slightly."
+   ]
