+    "## Following the artifacts (ViTs)\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Large ViTs recycle some uninformative patches as storage for global information (Darcet et al., *Vision\n",
+    "Transformers Need Registers*). In NAVE they tend to form a concept of their own, made of the most uncertain\n",
+    "tokens. Three views: when each artifact token joins it for good, their uncertainty before, and the concepts\n",
