+    "# Fine-tuning: which blocks change?\n",
+    "\n",
+    "A demo: a ResNet34 pretrained on ImageNet, fine-tuned on **EuroSAT** (satellite tiles, 10 land uses), a domain\n",
+    "far from ImageNet's photos. At every checkpoint, each block's representation of a fixed probe set, from the\n",
