+    "\n",
+    "**Needs:** `pip install \"nave-xai[animation]\" torch torchvision`. **Downloads:** EuroSAT (about 90 MB) and the\n",
+    "ImageNet ResNet34 weights (about 85 MB), once."
+   ]
